{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>For ask now of the former days</b>, he says: He will not forgive and will not prolong for you [discussion] concerning idolatry and concerning corruption through a graven image and any likeness, for He did with you what He has not done so for any nation in the world — He caused you to hear the voice of Elohim speaking from the midst of the fire, in order that His fear be upon your faces and you unite Him and not corrupt, and He took you for Himself as a nation from the midst of a nation through trials, through signs, and through wonders, so that you would not serve any besides Him. And you have seen with your own eyes all this, to know that YHWH — He is the Elohim; He is one and His name is one, and there is none besides Him. For from the heavens He caused you to hear His voice to teach you thereby the discipline of understanding, and on the earth He showed you His great fire burning to the heart of the heavens, and all His words you heard from the midst of the fire. And He brought you out before Him — like עַל פָּנָיו (Genesis 32:22) — by the great strength that is before Him. And after that the great name — He is Elohim in the heavens from above and on the earth from beneath, and there is none else — you shall keep His commandments and His statutes, in order that it be well with you in the heavens from above, and in order that you prolong days upon the earth from beneath."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T02:45:23.299414805Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}